Package: eegwhiten
Type: Package
Title: Whitening Transforms for EEG Covariance Matrices
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Yiming Shen
Maintainer: Yiming Shen <yiming.shen001@umb.edu>
Description:
    Whitening transforms (PCA, PCA on the correlation matrix, ZCA,
    ZCA on the correlation matrix, SVD and Cholesky) with a simple
    fit/transform API for EEG data. Rows are trials/epochs, columns
    are channels or features. Provides model objects for reusing
    whitening parameters across datasets, inverse transforms, and
    basic diagnostics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Suggests:
    RSpectra,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
